riss death  earlier this month Lee pleaded guilty to  tampering with evidence for allegedly  helping Frazee get rid of Barris cell  phone I think he is a true narcissist  he's a master manipulator  he probably manipulates every single  person that comes in contact with him  because he thinks he can Barriss parents  are suing Frazee for an unspecified  amount and have been granted temporary  custody of their one year old  granddaughter Frazee's attorneys have  filed a motion to dismiss the civil suit  claiming Beres parents do not have the  right to sue him gale  terrible story thank you very much Jamie
 

